  - m_Id: 4917792786
    m_Localized: '<b>RIVERFRONT NEXT</b>

      An original team-based Conquest shooter. Pre-alpha.


      <b>Created by:</b> Zachary Aars


      <b>Engine:</b> Unity 6

      <b>Networking:</b> Netcode for GameObjects and Unity Transport

      <b>Bots:</b> Unity AI Navigation

      <b>Interface:</b> uGUI and TextMesh Pro

      <b>Assets:</b> project-made, Unity template and sample content, and CC0 assets

      <b>Sidearm model:</b> Blaster Kit by Kenney (www.kenney.nl), CC0

      <b>Sound effects:</b> Unity template and sample audio


      The host decides damage, captures, tickets and the result; movement is client-driven.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
